OL,3,GNEWSARestored rocking horses bring back
OL,4,Achildhood memories
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe twin brothers behind a company
OL,7,Fmaking rocking horses in Kent have said
OL,8,Fthey keep a tissue box to hand as
OL,9,Fcustomers get emotional about
OL,10,Frecapturing their childhoods.
OL,12,FMarc Stevenson and Tony Stevenson,
OL,13,Ffounders of Stevenson Brothers Rocking
OL,14,FHorses, both recently turned 70, having
OL,15,Festablished the company on their 26th
OL,16,Fbirthdays in 1982.
OL,18,F"It's such an emotional thing to be
OL,19,Finvolved in," said Marc.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
